{
 "file": "EN/EVENT_DATA/MESSAGE/E700/E749_003.BMD",
 "entries": [
  {
   "id": "MND_000_0_1#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Futaba and I roamed the[n]snowy Shibuya streets[n]for quite some time...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_000_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Futaba",
   "en": "Curse you, Christmas!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_000_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Futaba",
   "en": "I was really hoping for some cake[n]or fried chicken, but there were[n]long lines everywhere!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_001_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Calm down.",
   "uk": "Заспокойся.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_001_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Let's just chill.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_001_0_0#2",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "What about your usual meal?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_002_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Futaba",
   "en": "Grr...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_003_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Futaba",
   "en": "Good plan!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_004_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Futaba",
   "en": "Even I know today's too special a day[n]for yakisoba.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_005_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Futaba",
   "en": "But still...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_005_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Futaba",
   "en": "The world should be thanking the[n]Phantom Thieves! I'd love a few[n]under-the-table donations!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_006_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Futaba",
   "en": "I wonder how many couples are[n]out there tonight.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_006_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Futaba",
   "en": "It, um... kinda feels like we're getting[n]swept up in the romantic atmosphere.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_007_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Let's get swept up.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_007_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Should we cancel Christmas?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_007_0_0#2",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "This is a special moment.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_008_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Futaba",
   "en": "O-Okay...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_009_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Futaba",
   "en": "No!",
   "uk": "Ні!",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_010_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Futaba",
   "en": "Huh, why?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_010_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Futaba",
   "en": "Ah...! That was so cheesy, I didn't even[n]notice it at first...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_011_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I won't be able to see Futaba[n]again after tomorrow...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_011_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "We spent a long time talking...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_012_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Futaba",
   "en": "Oh, before I forget...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_013_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Futaba",
   "en": "...Here.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_013_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Futaba",
   "en": "No matter how old you are, it's always[n]great getting a gift, huh?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_014_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Thank you.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_014_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I'll treasure it always.[clr 27]",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_015_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Futaba",
   "en": "I'm glad you're glad...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_018_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Futaba",
   "en": "So um...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_018_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Futaba",
   "en": "The present was important and[n]everything...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_019_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Futaba",
   "en": "But this Shido incident is blowing up[n]on the web. Threads are popping up[n]all over the place...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_019_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Futaba",
   "en": "And... they're talking about the[n]Phantom Thieves too.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_020_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Futaba",
   "en": "...I'm worried. There are cameras[n]everywhere in the city. It feels like[n]they're always watching...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_020_5_0#0",
   "speaker": "Futaba",
   "en": "I mean, if we get separated, then...!",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_999_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Sae",
   "en": "If that happens, there's no telling what[n]they'll do to you or your teammates.",
   "uk": "Якщо так станеться, хтозна, що вони[n]зроблять із тобою чи твоїми[n]товаришами.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_999_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Sae",
   "en": "There's even the possibility that they'll[n]fabricate a crime and move to arrest[n]you all.",
   "uk": "Можливо навіть, що вони сфабрикують[n]злочин і візьмуться[n]заарештувати вас усіх.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_999_1_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I have to turn myself in to[n]make sure Futaba stays safe...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_999_1_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "But telling her about it would[n]only cause her to panic...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_020_7_0#0",
   "speaker": "Futaba",
   "en": "...Huh?",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_021_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "It's nothing.",
   "uk": "Нічого.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_021_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I'm sorry.",
   "uk": "Вибачте.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_022_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Futaba",
   "en": "......",
   "uk": "......",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_023_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Futaba",
   "en": "Sorry 'bout that...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_024_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Futaba",
   "en": "...I'm gonna go home.",
   "uk": "...Я піду додому.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_025_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I'll walk you back.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "SEL_025_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Be careful.",
   "uk": "Будь обережний.",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_026_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Futaba",
   "en": "It's not far.",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_027_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Futaba",
   "en": "You too...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_029_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Futaba",
   "en": "I wish you wouldn't keep secrets from me...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_030_0_0#0",
   "speaker": "Futaba",
   "en": "I've been with you long enough to know[n]when you're not telling me things...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MSG_030_0_0#1",
   "speaker": "Futaba",
   "en": "Good night...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_031_0_0#0",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "I made Futaba worry...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  },
  {
   "id": "MND_031_0_0#1",
   "speaker": null,
   "en": "Even so, this is the only way...",
   "uk": "",
   "note": ""
  }
 ]
}